<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="{charset}">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<link rel="icon" href="{THEME}/images/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
<title>Сайт временно недоступен</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#eff4fb;color:#41465b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}
main{width:100%;max-width:620px;padding:48px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe5ef;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 16px 48px #2025350d}
.mark{display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:#eeedff;color:#514bce;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
h1{font-size:clamp(25px,5vw,36px);line-height:1.2;margin:24px 0 18px}
.reason{line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.reason>:first-child{margin-top:0}.reason>:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
a{color:#514bce}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #817afc;outline-offset:4px}
.hint{margin:24px 0 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #dfe5ef;color:#697386;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:480px){body{padding:16px}main{padding:28px 24px}}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{background:#141722;color:#edf0f7}main{background:#202535;border-color:#3b4357}.mark{background:#353052;color:#c6c1ff}.hint{border-color:#3b4357;color:#b5bfd0}a{color:#b9b4ff}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<span class="mark">Технические работы</span>
<h1>Сайт временно недоступен</h1>
<div class="reason">{reason}</div>
<p class="hint">Пожалуйста, зайдите немного позже.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
